Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-Fifth Episode\NThe Weapon of Death
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.74,0:02:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- I’m going faster!\N- No! I’m going faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.94,0:02:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, that's not true!\N- Yes, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.98,0:02:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get there first!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.26,0:02:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.26,0:02:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like there's some fun to\Nbe had, old man! Let's go too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:02:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, let’s go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:03:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do those two want to do?\N- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're coming too! Are you ready?\N- Yes, ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.78,0:03:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Go! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.02,0:03:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm winning! I'm telling you, I'm winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one left! I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.06,0:03:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Brake! Brake!\N- Pull the brake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.66,0:03:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull the brake, old man!\NPull the brake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.38,0:03:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What? "Pull the brake"?!\NBut how do I stop?! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.82,0:03:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing won't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.78,0:03:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch that road pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.70,0:03:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, old man!\N- Poor guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.06,0:03:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Who treated the old man like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.82,0:03:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look here! What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.54,0:04:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It fell from the road pirate's carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you coward! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit and run, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.10,0:04:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had arrived any later,\Nyou would have certainly died, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank God...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.06,0:04:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't catch up to\Nthat carriage, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry,\NI'll catch it, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.82,0:04:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He dropped this\Nbehind that carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.50,0:04:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can find out who it was\Nwith this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:05:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Sapphire! Let's look for him\Ntogether! I'll knock him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We searched all day,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but we didn't find anyone\Nwho knows about the carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.46,0:05:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheer up, Sapphire!\NToday we'll find a way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, of course.\N...for the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Go away, brat!\N- Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Tink is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What drug do you want to buy with only\N10 Yen? You're a pathetic idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.66,0:05:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me an idiot!\NYou're the idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly Father, forgive me\Nfor calling him an "idiot"!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.34,0:05:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tink!\N- Opal! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.30,0:05:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Tink:\Nwhat is this story about a drug?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends, the rabbit\Nand the badger, were run over..
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...by a carriage.\NIt was a black carriage, a horrible one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.02,0:05:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?\NA black carriage?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.02,0:06:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor things, I feel sorry for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They are looking for whoever hit you. Do you know anything about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.78,0:06:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.86,0:06:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He said they don't know whose carriage it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.18,0:06:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but that it passes through the Northern forest every day at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Northern forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.74,0:06:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- They're right, it passes through here.\N- True.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, these leaves haven't been trampled!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It means it hasn't passed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.58,0:06:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.10,0:06:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming from that direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.22,0:06:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.78,0:07:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the forest behind the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange... No one is allowed\Nto use the back gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.58,0:07:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Open up! Open up!\N- What do you want, child?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.06,0:07:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Open the gate!\N- It's forbidden to open it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But a black carriage just passed by!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.34,0:07:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no one passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a liar! I saw it!\NOpen! Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your mouth shut\Nand go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:08:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, open up! Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.34,0:08:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then I'll wait here!\NThere!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.82,0:08:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Until you've decided\Nto open that damn gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.82,0:08:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like it fell\Nright from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is definitely the\Ncarriage and that is the culprit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.86,0:08:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a ladder!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.82,0:08:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder where\Nthis corridor leads...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.94,0:08:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you sure no one saw you?\N- Yes, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.22,0:09:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who it is..!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.02,0:09:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.86,0:09:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a pleasure to see\NYour Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What could my father possibly\Nhave to discuss, in private,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,with those two scoundrels?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope it isn't something bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope so with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.42,0:09:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Your Majesty,\NI will deliver it into your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.18,0:09:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...as soon as it is completed.\N- Very well, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- May I go now?\N- Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:10:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Tell me what you were\Ndiscussing with the King and Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.66,0:10:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you are a spy,\Nif you want to know the agreements...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.86,0:10:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...that I made for the new\Nweapons I invented.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.90,0:10:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- On guard!\N- I am not a spy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a friend of the old man\Nwhom your carriage ran over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.02,0:10:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So much fuss\Nover that stupid accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.70,0:10:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come to punish you for the wrong\Nyou did to the old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.34,0:10:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You are insolent and a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,On guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.02,0:10:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems your back is against the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.82,0:10:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.02,0:10:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run away, you coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.42,0:11:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not running! I want to show you\Nhow my new weapon works!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.78,0:11:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on!\N- Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well? Is that all?\N- Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.46,0:11:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I have many others\Neven more powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see how they work!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What... What is it?\N- It's a rifle
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.06,0:11:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a birdlime gun, one of\Nmy most amusing inventions!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.82,0:11:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair that you use\Nsuch strange weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.74,0:11:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Have fun, I have things to do.\NSee you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.86,0:11:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run away, you coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.42,0:11:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so sticky!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.34,0:11:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a wine barrel!\NMaybe the wine will dissolve the birdlime!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.70,0:11:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurray, it worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:12:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire,\Nyou shouldn't use that gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is an emergency! Boy,\Nwhich way did the carriage go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrible smell!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's a foul-smelling fruit!\N- Truly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our lucky break!\NWhen the carriage left,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I threw it at it, so\Nnow we can follow its tracks..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.78,0:12:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...with our sense of smell!\NForgive me, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.74,0:12:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We are right\Nin the middle of the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.94,0:12:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell a very strong stench
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.22,0:12:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be in here
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.34,0:12:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And now how do we\Nopen the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.06,0:12:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not moving at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:12:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can find an entrance\Nby climbing the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Flight test! Open the ceiling!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.10,0:13:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we can enter through here
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.74,0:13:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.50,0:13:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The King of Silverland\Nand Duke Duralumin..
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.34,0:13:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...have finally promised\Nto buy this aircraft from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.54,0:14:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I congratulate myself\Nfor this masterpiece!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I understand! Dad and\NDuralumin were arguing...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.10,0:14:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...whether or not\Nto buy this aircraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.58,0:14:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it must be a\Ntruly terrible weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.30,0:14:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Sapphire: let's get\Nrevenge on that road pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.62,0:14:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's do it! And let's\Ndestroy these terrible weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- I agree!\N- Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.50,0:14:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.14,0:14:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.14,0:15:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run away! They're\Njust children! Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.26,0:15:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the aircraft!\NWe could destroy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You break the pipe and let out the steam.\N- Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.70,0:15:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.26,0:15:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- To hell with you!\N- Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.14,0:15:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't put down\Nthat bomb immediately,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- this child will die!\N- Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Child!\N- Throw it! Don't worry about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.82,0:15:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.70,0:15:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let the child go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.34,0:16:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.22,0:16:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get rid of that nuisance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.02,0:16:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.46,0:16:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat it, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.62,0:16:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.70,0:16:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent! The altitude is fine,\Nthe direction too,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.90,0:16:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- and the engine is in good condition!\N- Set me free, you road pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.54,0:17:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it feel\Nto be on the aircraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.70,0:17:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You damn monster, untie me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.42,0:17:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Scream all you want, I'm going to throw you\Nout of the aircraft anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,so you'll have a nice flight\Nand be crushed on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,On the ground, no!\NHelp, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.42,0:17:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry as much as you want,\Nyou annoying brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.74,0:17:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's high enough\Nto throw you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.74,0:17:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My god, it's so high!\NHelp, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.86,0:17:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you'll take a nice flight\Nwith no return!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.86,0:17:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- I've finally caught up with you!\N- That's right, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.06,0:17:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Such tenacity!\N- Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.54,0:17:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I knew you'd come to save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, prepare to die as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.82,0:18:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hip, hip, hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, what is that thing?\N- It's a balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.34,0:18:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's a flying ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Your Majesty! The flying\Nboat has been delivered. Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you we could trust them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.62,0:19:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but it's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.94,0:19:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Princess Sapphire!\N- Sapphire, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I arrested the driver, because\Nhe wanted to kill this child.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.02,0:19:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it occur to you, father,\Nto order such a terrible weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.14,0:19:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,from such a horrible man?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be foolish, Princess!\NThat man is a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.30,0:19:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He has built\Nsome extremely powerful weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.66,0:19:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will be able to defeat us if we\Nare in possession of those weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.10,0:19:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- No country!\N- Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.06,0:20:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He who makes weapons to kill\Nis far from being a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.86,0:20:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, do not pay attention\Nto what a child says!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.58,0:20:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, release that man\Nand make sure he can...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.06,0:20:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...continue to build for us\Never more powerful weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.38,0:20:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him money\Nand, if you don't have enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.38,0:20:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,impose a few more taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.62,0:20:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you! Who are you to impose\Ntaxes on the poor like us...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...to pay a monster\Nlike that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.06,0:20:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But we need\Nto become strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.06,0:20:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Other countries could attack us\Nat any moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,so we need\Ngood weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.82,0:20:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need the aircraft\Nto become stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.62,0:20:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And nobody, then, could\Nstop that man...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.26,0:20:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...from building others\Nfor other countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.74,0:20:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, it is not the time\Nto listen to a little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Your Majesty!\N- Father, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.30,0:20:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up! He's escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough! I've decided that\NI will no longer sell you this aircraft!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to sell it to another country!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:21:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do? Do\Nyou want to sell it to our enemies?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I'll do! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! We'll buy it! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.78,0:21:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get out, if you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.90,0:21:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, let me go!\NLet me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.50,0:21:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I won't let you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.46,0:21:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Untie the rope, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you! Untie the rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.46,0:21:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.02,0:21:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I won't allow you to sell\Nthe aircraft to some other country!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!\NI'll untie that rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.30,0:22:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! All this work lost!\NThe fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.50,0:22:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If he reaches the\Naircraft, I am lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.26,0:22:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.90,0:22:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Peace to his soul. Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.34,0:22:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor man..!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.10,0:22:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man, the\Nroad pirate is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.94,0:22:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Now you can forgive him.\N- What a great loss!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.46,0:22:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Fools!\N- You are mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.74,0:22:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you were right.\NHorrible weapons like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.58,0:23:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,...do not make us stronger. Other\Ncountries would make even more deadly ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.66,0:23:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, we do not need\Nnew, horrible weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.66,0:23:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To defend the country, my\Narm and my heart will be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.06,0:23:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your words make\Nme ashamed of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.22,0:23:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I am determined to do\Nanything so that the country...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.42,0:23:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...may live more happily. Do you\Nwant to help me, my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.58,0:23:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Of course, father! With pleasure!\N- I am happy about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.46,0:23:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- I will always support you, Sapphire!\N- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.42,0:23:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It means that we will work\Ntogether, all three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.46,0:23:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
