Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.62,0:24:16.94,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.94,0:24:20.94,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k33}{\k33}A{\k22}ku{\k25}ma {\k17}ga {\k35}ku{\k36}te {\k24}mo {\k19}a{\k18}ra{\k30}shi {\k11}ga {\k36}ku{\k33}te {\k28}mo
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.94,0:24:20.94,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.94,0:24:24.38,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}tsu{\k17}na{\k27}i{\k21}da {\k17}ko{\k21}ko{\k29}ro {\k16}wa {\k22}ha{\k32}na{\k26}re{\k14}na{\k79}i
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.94,0:24:24.38,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Our bonded hearts will never part.
